# Number Input

An enhanced numeric input field that handles invalid values and enforces constraints like min/max and custom conditions.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/number-input.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { NumberInput } from '@/registry/number-input'

const age = ref(25)
</script>

<template>
  <NumberInput 
    v-model="age" 
    :min="18" 
    :max="99" 
    :step="1" 
  />
</template>
```

