### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `min` | `number` | `undefined` | Minimum allowed value. |
| `max` | `number` | `undefined` | Maximum allowed value. |
| `step` | `number` | `undefined` | Stepping interval for the numeric input. |
| `condition` | `Function` | `undefined` | Custom validation function `(value: number) => boolean`. |
| `v-model` | `number` | `undefined` | The numeric value. |

## Input Group Version

The `InputGroupNumberInput` variant is designed to be used inside an `InputGroup` component, featuring transparent backgrounds and no borders.
